6.3.4 Summary of results. To summarize, the experiments
verified the effectiveness and efficiency of our proposal. While
the adaptation of the regret-ratio based algorithm hd-rrms
fails to provide a rank-regret representative, 2drrr, mdrrr,
andmdrc found small sets with small rank-regrets. Although
the rank-regret of the outputs of 2drrr andmdrc can be
larger than k, in our experiments and our measurements
those were always below k.mdrrr provided small outputs
that as expected, always guarantees the rank-regret of k.
